// test_gpu_stage1.ailang — ISOLATION TEST: Discover + BAR map only
// Build: ./ailang.x TestCode/test_gpu_stage1.ailang test_gpu_stage1.x
// Run:   sudo ./test_gpu_stage1.x
//
// Tests ONLY:
//   1. GPU_Discover (sysfs scan — no hardware writes)
//   2. GPU_BAR_MapMMIO (mmap BAR2 — no hardware writes)
//   3. GPU_BAR_MapVRAM (mmap BAR0 — no hardware writes)
//   4. One MMIO read (GRBM_STATUS — read-only)
//   5. One VRAM read (offset 0 — read-only)
//
// If this locks up: the mmap itself is the problem.
// If this works: hardware access via mmap is fine, proceed to stage 2.

LibraryImport.Drivers.AMDGPU.AMDGPUFamily
LibraryImport.Drivers.AMDGPU.AMDGPUDiscover
LibraryImport.Drivers.AMDGPU.AMDGPUBAR
LibraryImport.Drivers.AMDGPU.AMDGPUPM4Regs

SubRoutine.Main {
    PrintMessage("=== GPU STAGE 1: Discover + BAR Map ===\n\n")

    // --- Step 1: Discover ---
    PrintMessage("[S1] Discovering AMD GPUs...\n")
    n_gpus = GPU_Discover()
    PrintMessage("[S1] Found GPUs: ")
    PrintNumber(n_gpus)
    PrintMessage("\n")
    IfCondition EqualTo(n_gpus, 0) ThenBlock: {
        PrintMessage("[S1] FAIL: No AMD GPUs found\n")
        SystemCall(60, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0)
    }

    gpu = 0

    // --- Step 2: Map MMIO BAR ---
    PrintMessage("[S1] Mapping MMIO BAR...\n")
    GPU_BAR_Init()
    rc = GPU_BAR_MapMMIO(gpu)
    PrintMessage("[S1] MMIO map result: ")
    PrintNumber(rc)
    PrintMessage("\n")
    IfCondition EqualTo(rc, 0) ThenBlock: {
        PrintMessage("[S1] FAIL: MMIO map failed\n")
        SystemCall(60, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0)
    }

    // --- Step 3: Map VRAM BAR ---
    PrintMessage("[S1] Mapping VRAM BAR...\n")
    rc = GPU_BAR_MapVRAM(gpu)
    PrintMessage("[S1] VRAM map result: ")
    PrintNumber(rc)
    PrintMessage("\n")
    IfCondition EqualTo(rc, 0) ThenBlock: {
        PrintMessage("[S1] FAIL: VRAM map failed\n")
        SystemCall(60, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0)
    }

    // --- Step 4: Single MMIO read (GRBM_STATUS — always readable) ---
    PrintMessage("[S1] Reading GRBM_STATUS (MMIO read-only test)...\n")
    grbm = GPU_Rd32(gpu, SIReg.GRBM_STATUS)
    PrintMessage("[S1] GRBM_STATUS = 0x")
    PrintHex(grbm)
    PrintMessage("\n")

    // --- Step 5: Single VRAM read ---
    PrintMessage("[S1] Reading VRAM offset 0 (VRAM read-only test)...\n")
    vram_val = GPU_VramRd32(gpu, 0)
    PrintMessage("[S1] VRAM[0] = 0x")
    PrintHex(vram_val)
    PrintMessage("\n")

    // --- Cleanup ---
    PrintMessage("\n[S1] Unmapping BARs...\n")
    GPU_BAR_Unmap(gpu)

    PrintMessage("\n=== STAGE 1 PASS ===\n")
    SystemCall(60, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0)
}

RunTask(Main)
